# =============================================================================
# Separation of duties — sensitive paths (#2880)
# =============================================================================
# These paths handle authentication, money movement, database schema, and
# row-level-security (RLS) policies. They MUST require review beyond the single
# default owner. Each rule lists the existing owner PLUS a second-reviewer team
# so that, combined with branch protection ("Require review from Code Owners"
# and "Required approvals: 2"), no single person can self-approve a change to
# auth, SQL, or RLS. See .github/branch-protection.md → "Needs Human Action".
#
# NOTE: CODEOWNERS makes a path owned by *any one* listed owner; true two-person
# review is enforced by requiring 2 approvals at the branch-protection level in
# addition to code-owner review. Both halves are required for real separation of
# duties — see branch-protection.md.
#
# The invalid placeholder team (@jrmoulckers-org/security-reviewers) has been
# removed so this file validates cleanly. The sensitive-path rules below are kept
# as an explicit inventory of what must get a dedicated reviewer.
# TODO(human): add a real second reviewer to these paths — create a GitHub team
# (org repos) or add a second collaborator handle (personal repos cannot use
# @org/team handles), give them write access, then list them alongside
# @jrmoulckers on each rule below. Pair this with "Require approvals: 2" +
# "Require review from Code Owners" in branch protection for true separation of
# duties (#2880).

# Backend API service (override of the single-owner rule above)
/services/api/                                @jrmoulckers

# Database schema & migrations
/services/api/supabase/migrations/            @jrmoulckers
**/*.sql                                      @jrmoulckers

# Row-Level-Security (RLS) policy files
**/*rls*.sql                                  @jrmoulckers
**/*_rls_policies.sql                         @jrmoulckers
**/*polic*.sql                                @jrmoulckers

# Authentication, passkeys & device attestation (Edge Functions)
/services/api/supabase/functions/auth-*/      @jrmoulckers
/services/api/supabase/functions/passkey-*/   @jrmoulckers
/services/api/supabase/functions/verify-device-attestation/ @jrmoulckers
/services/api/supabase/functions/consent-management/        @jrmoulckers
/services/api/supabase/functions/account-delete/            @jrmoulckers

# Generic auth/passkey paths anywhere in the tree (defense in depth)
**/auth/**                                    @jrmoulckers
**/passkey/**                                 @jrmoulckers

# Security policy & response docs
/services/api/security/                       @jrmoulckers
